  "notes": "HIGH CONFIDENCE — primary-tier (WITS/UN Comtrade). India world total 2024: USD 417.32M across ~239,920 MT. India is the dominant world origin for guar gum. Markets are industrial/Western (USA ~23%, Russia, Germany, China) and demand is partly tied to oil & gas fracturing fluid as well as food-grade thickener use — worth splitting those buyer personas in content. Strong candidate for German- and Russian-language market pages, and notable as one of the few products here where Russia is a top-3 market."
